OPT invokes the following third-party programs as separate processes (aggregation,
not linking). Each keeps its own license. Verify again whenever a version is pinned.

- subfinder, httpx, naabu, katana, nuclei (ProjectDiscovery) — MIT
- amass (OWASP) — Apache-2.0
- OWASP ZAP — Apache-2.0
- nmap — Nmap Public Source License (do not bundle into commercial images without reviewing the OEM terms)
- sqlmap — GPL-2.0 (subprocess only, never imported)

